---

---

<!-- about -->
<section class="reveal bg-bg-secondary/50 px-4 py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center">
      <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">About this project</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="glass about-card">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="28" height="28" />
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Why ShockStack?</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-fg-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          ShockStack was born from years of building production apps and wanting
          a single, opinionated starting point that actually works. No
          starter-kit bloat, no half-baked integrations &mdash; just the
          patterns that have proven themselves in real projects, wired together
          with sensible defaults.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="glass about-card">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <svg
            width="28"
            height="28"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="text-accent-cyan"
          >
            <path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path>
            <path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"></path>
            <path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path>
          </svg>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">Built by Spectacle</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-fg-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
          ShockStack was developed by
          <a
            href="https://spectaclesoftware.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-accent-purple hover:text-accent-pink transition-colors"
            >Spectacle Software</a
          > for use across client projects and internal tools. It represents the distilled
          best practices from building modern full-stack applications for businesses
          of all sizes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* about cards */
  .about-card {
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
